00:04:52.479 --> 00:04:59.199 align:start position:19%
Good afternoon, council members. My name
is Patricia McCoy, and I am here to

00:04:56.960 --> 00:05:03.680 align:start position:19%
express my gratitude for a shift in
direction. It has come to my attention

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:07.680 align:start position:19%
that Councilman White and Councilwoman
Aldrich have been working with legal

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:11.919 align:start position:19%
counsel and legislators to fix a heinous
error in the original draft of this

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:16.720 align:start position:19%
ordinance. By working to limit this
authority strictly and exclusively to

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:21.039 align:start position:19%
abandoned and unoccupied properties,
they are demonstrating what true public

00:05:18.639 --> 00:05:25.520 align:start position:19%
service looks like. So, thank you for
listening to your constituents and for

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:29.840 align:start position:19%
respecting the sanctity of the Wyoming
home. However, as we move through this

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:34.080 align:start position:19%
committee process, we must ensure the
final language is bulletproof. To assist

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:38.400 align:start position:19%
in that effort, I've already emailed a
formal proposed amendment to each member

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:42.560 align:start position:19%
of this committee. This amendment is not
just about policy. It is about

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:47.199 align:start position:19%
constitutional survival. As I noted in
my email, the Wyoming Supreme Court has

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:52.000 align:start position:19%
made it clear in cases like OOIL versus
state and Vasquez versus state that our

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:56.400 align:start position:19%
state constitution article 1 section 4
is a higher shield than federal law. We

00:05:54.880 --> 00:06:01.199 align:start position:19%
do not allow government fishing
expeditions in Wyoming. By limiting this

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:05.039 align:start position:19%
ordinance strictly to unoccupied and
abandoned structures, you solve the

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:09.199 align:start position:19%
city's safety concerns regarding trouble
spots without violating the rights of

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:12.160 align:start position:19%
law-abiding neighbors. It keeps the
government out of our living rooms and

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:16.560 align:start position:19%
maintains the council doctrine that
Wyoming citizens cherish. I urge this

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:20.240 align:start position:19%
committee to adopt the strict limitation
language I provided. Let's finish the

00:06:18.639 --> 00:06:23.600 align:start position:19%
work Councilman White and Councilwoman
Aldrich have started and bring this

00:06:21.919 --> 00:06:27.680 align:start position:19%
ordinance into compliance with our
state's proud legal tradition. We are

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:31.520 align:start position:19%
your neighbors and your employers and we
thank those of you who have chosen to

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:35.080 align:start position:19%
listen. Thank you.
