especially when it comes to private

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:55.199 align:start position:19%
property and the sanctuary of one's home
or business. Liberty is not always

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:58.720 align:start position:19%
efficient. It can be inconvenient. It
can frustrate enforcement. But those

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:03.519 align:start position:19%
inconveniences are not flaws in the
system. They are safeguards to keep the

00:15:00.959 --> 00:15:06.800 align:start position:19%
power from growing unchecked.
This proposed ordinance lowers the

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:10.320 align:start position:19%
standard of government entry onto
private property. It allows

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:15.040 align:start position:19%
administrative warrants not only when
there is clear evidence of wrongdoing or

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:20.639 align:start position:19%
imminent danger, but also for routine
inspections or when officials believe

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:24.000 align:start position:19%
seeking consent might slow them down.
This is a meaningful shift when warrants

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:28.399 align:start position:19%
are no longer tied to specific
suspicion. They stop being a shield for

00:15:26.399 --> 00:15:32.880 align:start position:19%
citizens and begin to function as a tool
of compliance.

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:37.519 align:start position:19%
I'm especially concerned because when
authority like this is created, it does

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:42.240 align:start position:19%
not expire on its own. It applies across
departments, across future councils, and

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:47.040 align:start position:19%
across circumstances we cannot foresee
today. Law should be written not just

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:52.000 align:start position:19%
for the best intentions of the present,
but the realities of the future.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:56.000 align:start position:19%
Wyman has always believed the property m
property rights matter most when they

00:15:54.000 --> 00:16:00.639 align:start position:19%
are inconvenient to the government, not
when they are easy. Consent that can be

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:04.320 align:start position:19%
bypassed when it comes when it becomes
frustrating is no longer meaningful

00:16:02.399 --> 00:16:08.320 align:start position:19%
consent.
We should be very careful before

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:11.920 align:start position:19%
normalizing forced entry into private
property is a routine administrative

00:16:09.839 --> 00:16:15.920 align:start position:19%
option. Public safety can be protected
without permanently expanding government

00:16:13.839 --> 00:16:19.920 align:start position:19%
authority into places it has no
historically belonged.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:24.320 align:start position:19%
I urge this body to either reject this
ordinance as it written substantially

00:16:22.399 --> 00:16:30.000 align:start position:19%
written or substantially narrow it
because liberty because once liberty is

00:16:26.639 --> 00:16:33.680 align:start position:19%
reduced it is rarely restored.
So as I said before I'm not saying we

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:36.959 align:start position:19%
have to completely remove it. I do
understand that we can maybe detail it

00:16:35.279 --> 00:16:40.720 align:start position:19%
up. But I will tell you because I know
in the last thing there was comments

